<title>HONG KONG: Luks Ind 1996 net loss HK$244.73 mln.</title>
<headline>Luks Ind 1996 net loss HK$244.73 mln.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended December 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   27.8 loss   vs  9.9 gain</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    nil	   vs  nil</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  15.0 loss   vs  nil</p>
<p>    Net			    244.73 loss vs  80.13 profit</p>
<p>    Turnover		     686.81	vs  1,116.73</p>
<p>    Company name		 Luks Industrial Co Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  June 19-25</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   N/A</p>
<p>NOTE - Luks Industrial manufactures and sells electronic products.</p>
<p>The exceptional items for continuing consolidated operations represent the provision for doubtful debts.</p>
<p>Total dividend for year is nil vs nil.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
